<title>USA: Supermercados Norte sets $220 mln in 144A notes.</title>
<headline>Supermercados Norte sets $220 mln in 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Supermercados Norte of Argentina was priced in the private placement on Wednesday, via Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc, according to market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER SUPERMERCADOS NORTE</p>
<p>AMT $220 MLN	 COUPON 10.875 PCT MATURITY 2/09/2004</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 8/09/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B1    YIELD 10.875 PCT  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P NR	  SPREAD 487.5 BP   CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
